{"id":"ccbc16:puzzle:33","answer":"THE MISSING INK","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"我毫无头绪","html":"<p>注意到黑格与红格加起来，正好是全部小题的数量（包括没有题面的题目，以及点不开的题目）。每个小题答案都是某个有序集合中的元素。</p>","text":"注意到黑格与红格加起来，正好是全部小题的数量（包括没有题面的题目，以及点不开的题目）。每个小题答案都是某个有序集合中的元素。","assetIds":[]},{"number":2,"title":"该如何提取","html":"<p>将四块红色部分连起来。例如第四列是中国常见于书房的四样东西，取第二个。</p>","text":"将四块红色部分连起来。例如第四列是中国常见于书房的四样东西，取第二个。","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"<p>小题答案来自若干集合，分别是宙斯的七位妻子（<code>LETO</code>、<code>METIS</code>），六个三角函数（<code>COT</code>、<code>TAN</code>），十二音（<code>CSHARP</code>）、文房四宝（<code>BRUSH</code>、<code>PAPER</code>）。</p>\n<p>每个集合都有默认顺序，提取标红的元素可得 THEMIS、SIN、G、INK，连起来即答案 <code>THE MISSING INK</code>。</p>\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>METIS</div>\n<div>THEMIS</div>\n<div>EURYNOME</div>\n<div>DEMETER</div>\n<div>MNEMOSYNE</div>\n<div>LETO</div>\n<div>HERA</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>SIN</div>\n<div>COS</div>\n<div>TAN</div>\n<div>COT</div>\n<div>SEC</div>\n<div>CSC</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>C</div>\n<div>C#</div>\n<div>D</div>\n<div>D#</div>\n<div>E</div>\n<div>F</div>\n<div>F#</div>\n<div>G</div>\n<div>G#</div>\n<div>A</div>\n<div>A#</div>\n<div>B</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>BRUSH</div>\n<div>INK</div>\n<div>PAPER</div>\n<div>INKSTONE</div>\n</div>\n</div>","text":"小题答案来自若干集合，分别是宙斯的七位妻子（\nLETO\n、\nMETIS\n），六个三角函数（\nCOT\n、\nTAN\n），十二音（\nCSHARP\n）、文房四宝（\nBRUSH\n、\nPAPER\n）。\n\n每个集合都有默认顺序，提取标红的元素可得 THEMIS、SIN、G、INK，连起来即答案\nTHE MISSING INK\n。\n\nMETIS\n\nTHEMIS\n\nEURYNOME\n\nDEMETER\n\nMNEMOSYNE\n\nLETO\n\nHERA\n\nSIN\n\nCOS\n\nTAN\n\nCOT\n\nSEC\n\nCSC\n\nC\n\nC#\n\nD\n\nD#\n\nE\n\nF\n\nF#\n\nG\n\nG#\n\nA\n\nA#\n\nB\n\nBRUSH\n\nINK\n\nPAPER\n\nINKSTONE","refId":null,"assetIds":[]},"extended":{"html":"","text":"","assetIds":[]},"interactive":{"html":"<style>\n#pm_container {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n}\n.pmcol {\n    margin: 10px;\n    border: 2px solid black;\n    padding: 20px;\n    background-color: white;\n    width: 150px;\n}\n.pmcol div {\n    height: 40px;\n    margin: 2px;\n    background-color: black;\n    color: grey;\n}\n.pmcol div.pm_red {\n    background-color: red;\n    color: black;\n}\n</style>\n<div id=\"pm_container\">\n    <div class=\"pmcol\">\n        <div></div>\n        <div class=\"pm_red\"></div>\n        <div></div>\n        <div></div>\n        <div></div>\n        <div></div>\n        <div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pmcol\">\n        <div class=\"pm_red\"></div>\n        <div></div>\n        <div></div>\n        <div></div>\n        <div></div>\n        <div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pmcol\">\n        <div></div>\n        <div></div>\n        <div></div>\n        <div></div>\n        <div></div>\n        <div></div>\n        <div></div>\n        <div class=\"pm_red\"></div>\n        <div></div>\n        <div></div>\n        <div></div>\n        <div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pmcol\">\n        <div></div>\n        <div class=\"pm_red\"></div>\n        <div></div>\n        <div></div>\n    </div>\n</div>"},"sourceMetadata":{"type":1,"answer_type":1,"extend_data":"{\"pid\":33,\"imgUrl\":\"5f980ebd803e4e5698d755196b983c60.webp\",\"color\":\"#000\",\"top\":\"960px\",\"left\":\"1110px\",\"veryFirst\":true}","pgid":3,"pg_name":"印刷","resolved_extend_assets":["https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/5f980ebd803e4e5698d755196b983c60.webp"]},"failedAssets":[],"assets":[{"id":"asset-bde0068e12729143baf7346a","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/5f980ebd803e4e5698d755196b983c60.webp","path":"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/5f980ebd803e4e5698d755196b983c60.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":5388,"sha256":"aeab9d10bcc86fdcd08b59a7d061a4f1ca61666b896b28f9d8617a07e6d14b06","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["puzzle"],"contexts":["sourceMetadata"]}]}
